&lt;h2 id=&#34;as-simple-as-you-expect&#34;&gt;As simple as you expect&amp;hellip;
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;
  &lt;img src=&#34;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/iamgio/quarkdown/project-files/images/code-paper.png&#34; alt=&#34;Paper code demo&#34;&gt;
  &lt;p align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Inspired by: &lt;a href=&#34;https://news.mit.edu/2025/x-ray-flashes-nearby-supermassive-black-hole-accelerate-mysteriously-0113&#34;&gt;X-ray flashes from a nearby supermassive black hole accelerate mysteriously&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 align=&#34;right&#34;&gt;...as complex as you need.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;
  &lt;img src=&#34;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/iamgio/quarkdown/project-files/images/code-chart.png&#34; alt=&#34;Chart code demo&#34;&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;targets&#34;&gt;Targets
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HTML&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;:white_check_mark: Plain output (default)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;:white_check_mark: Slides &lt;sup&gt;via &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://revealjs.com&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;reveal.js&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;:white_check_mark: Paged (books, articles) &lt;sup&gt;via &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://pagedjs.org&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;paged.js&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;em&gt;Paged documents require a webserver to render in the browser. See the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#options&#34; &gt;&lt;code&gt;-p&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; option below.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PDF&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;:white_check_mark: All document types and features supported by HTML are also supported when exporting to PDF.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Check the wiki&amp;rsquo;s &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/iamgio/quarkdown/wiki/pdf-export&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;PDF export&lt;/a&gt; page to learn more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The desired document type can be set by calling the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/iamgio/quarkdown/wiki/document-metadata&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;code&gt;.doctype&lt;/code&gt; function&lt;/a&gt; within the source itself:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;.doctype {slides}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;.doctype {paged}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
